oise State's decision to go for it on fourth down instead of punting ended up backfiring when San Diego State got the stop and went on to kick a game-winning 42-yard field goal Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:46:11.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50560141/boise-state-4th-gamble-backfires-san-diego-state-wins","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chaos takes over the Big Ten: UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State all lose in Week 12","description":"UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State all lost to unranked teams in a year where parity is the ever-present theme.","published":"2026-11-22T07:25:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedayfinal112126/week-12-top-games-highlights-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-22T06:30:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions112126/cfp-predictions-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College Football Playoff top 12 projection after Week 12","description":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 12.","published":"2026-11-22T14:49:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552244/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:48:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4837460/audavion-collins","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audavion_Collins"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Audavion Collins","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audavion_Collins","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:38Z","intro":"Audavion Collins is an American college football cornerback for the Penn State Nittany Lions. He previously played for the Mississippi State Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Collins attended Newton High School in Covington, Georgia. As a senior he had 62 tackles with one interception and also had five receptions for 150 yards and two touchdowns. He committed to Mississippi State University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Collins did not play in a game his lone season at Mississippi State in 2022. He entered the transfer portal after the season and committed to Penn State. He played in six games his first year at Penn State in 2023 and had three tackles and 16 games in 2024, recording 26 tackles and an interception. Collins became a starter in 2025, starting all 13 games and finishing the season with 47 tackles. He returned to Penn State for the 2026 season."}]}}